{"version":1,"key":"card:55","content":{"id":55,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"476df65b-f357-43ca-92d2-f424645085ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令可以查看文件的内容"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"3a5f860f-1be7-4632-81f7-8e38fda50140","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d6b1eb81-fcf2-4974-a768-a68907e28123","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 查看 hello.c 的文件内容\n~ » cat hello.c\n#include<stdio.h>\nint main() {\n    printf(\"Hello World!\");\n    return 0;\n}","collabId":"8fbbd02d-97b9-4da3-8aaa-341d68fed017","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2e0ed71a-7d9c-4f02-8d76-1a7bb923e78b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-n"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项来显示行号"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"d6639004-a677-449f-9494-6671e88bcb79","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c2b51f64-c39d-4537-a0d9-9c0ad132471c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 查看 hello.c 的文件内容，并显示行号\n~ » cat -n hello.c\n     1  #include<stdio.h>\n     2  int main() {\n     3      printf(\"Hello World!\");\n     4      return 0;\n     5  }","collabId":"880ea2e3-fbcf-4a7c-82b7-c470452a45b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f8892e0-7f95-4d9a-aa2e-6de91464f5ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以查看多个文件，并将其内容依次显示在屏幕上"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"e5d45fdf-63da-4634-b57f-d81bac130bea","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cd3d231b-cdb2-43a7-a68a-27d392e63698","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » cat hello.c hello.md\n#include<stdio.h>\nint main() {\n    printf(\"Hello World!\");\n    return 0;\n}\n## Hello World\n\n\nThis is markdown file!","collabId":"f529f46b-981b-4d75-a7ac-7f5e4a1f8962","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"104bfe95-b587-4ab3-9357-f02b29bb5ecb","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的特点是一次性读取文件的所有的内容，然后全部显示在屏幕上，所以对于比较长的文件，我们比较难以阅读，需要滚动屏幕才可以读取到前面的内容。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"597fda97-62be-467a-a0f7-6e343142c3ee","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"00bdcb29-5d5f-4cc5-bcb0-1db1a73b2116","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有一个与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相似的命令是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tac"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 反着写就是它了，它的作用也是查看文件，不过是倒序输出的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Bash","uuid":"3e5f772b-43e2-4253-a5bc-170414267808","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"26317363-2030-46d6-a95f-d56643dda29e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » tac hello.c\n}\n    return 0;\n    printf(\"Hello World!\");\nint main() {\n#include<stdio.h>","collabId":"d08f06ca-d40d-4244-8e77-9e589bbab820","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ba3ced9b-6bc2-45bb-83f1-ed5454f1b83e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"man tac"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 了解该命令的更多信息，该命令在实际中并不常用，了解即可。"}]}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/cat"],"createTime":1689001716360,"updateTime":1745155423315,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745155423315}}